{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I fear this town is on it's last legs..I worry what this could mean for the state of the island. I don't trust the authority here anymore.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T06:57:08.805000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743000102897188886","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"They are good people, but their priorities and not where I would prefer them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T06:58:16.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743000387694362644","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"It is difficult to start something new on their own. They 'ave made a new home and face a world that is against them. I am sad to see how they have handled the struggles around them, they make it harder on themselves\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:03:40.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743001747005636649","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I don't think I knew what I was getting myself into when I decided to be a part of this colony. I want to build peace and now the island is flooded and the island is on the brink of war.\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:05:05.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743002100493189131","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I want to help but it seems local politics are getting in the way.\" She says with distaste","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:06:04.958000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743002351685599233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"To be fair, the island was already at war when we arrived. Tomorrow I hope those around in this town look to explore the temple tomorrow\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:08:09.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743002875466088538","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"We could make a friend instead of another enemy\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:08:43.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743003017200271441","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"I hope so. I left some notes on the bulletin board telling others they need to start prioritizing these things for the sake of everyone. I hope they listen, I fear they won't\"","created_at":"2020-08-12T07:10:17.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"743003410604752946","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
